# Identity and the tacks (B9): i_d x is x; x l_eft y is x; x r_ight y
# is y. They are not scalar functions: an array argument is returned
# whole, never item by item.
== SOURCE
i_d 5
i_d 1 2 3
3 l_eft 4
3 r_ight 4
1 l_eft 1 2 3
3 [l_eft + r_ight] 4
== TYPE
Int
Int
Int
Int
Int
Int
== RESULT
5
1 2 3
3
4
1
7
